<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Dump Collector on davidstamen</title><link>https://davidstamen.com/tags/dump-collector/</link><description>Recent content in Dump Collector on davidstamen</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><copyright>Copyright © 2008–2026, David Stamen. All rights reserved.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2014 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://davidstamen.com/tags/dump-collector/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Configuring ESXi 5.5 Dump Collector</title><link>https://davidstamen.com/2014/06/10/configuring-esxi-5-5-dump-collector/</link><pubDate>Tue, 10 Jun 2014 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://davidstamen.com/2014/06/10/configuring-esxi-5-5-dump-collector/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Thank you to everyone who listened to me on the EMEA vBrownbag. Here are copies of documentation and scripts on how to configure ESXi to use the remote dump collector.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="check-the-esxi-dump-collector-configuration-example"&gt;Check the ESXi Dump Collector Configuration Example:&lt;a class="heading-anchor" href="#check-the-esxi-dump-collector-configuration-example" aria-label="Link to this section"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Foreach ($vmhost in (get-vmhost)){&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$esxcli = Get-EsxCli -vmhost $vmhost&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$esxcli.system.coredump.network.get()}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="fig-zoom" href="https://davidstamen.com/images/screenshot.361.jpg" data-fancybox="mdb9bd2bc4c69ce86803151b45a5f4f38e"&#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://davidstamen.com/images/screenshot.361.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="setting-the-esxi-dump-collector-example"&gt;Setting the ESXi Dump Collector Example:&lt;a class="heading-anchor" href="#setting-the-esxi-dump-collector-example" aria-label="Link to this section"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Foreach ($vmhost in (get-vmhost)) {&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$esxcli = Get-EsxCli -vmhost $vmhost&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$esxcli.system.coredump.network.set($null, “vmk0″, “IPtoDumpCollector″, “6500″)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;$esxcli.system.coredump.network.set($true)}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="fig-zoom" href="https://davidstamen.com/images/screenshot.351.jpg" data-fancybox="mdb9bd2bc4c69ce86803151b45a5f4f38e"&#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://davidstamen.com/images/screenshot.351.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>